ine for \"jazz festivals near me\" or \"outdoor jazz events [your city/state]\" to find events in your area. Remember to check the dates, lineups, and ticket information (if applicable) for each event before attending. Enjoy the outdoor jazz experience!\nI'll definitely search for jazz festivals and events in my area. I'm excited to check out some outdoor jazz concerts this summer. By the way, I've been thinking about learning to play the saxophone. Do you think it's a good instrument for a beginner, and are there any online resources you'd recommend for learning?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"gpt4_d6585ce8:answer_f999b05b_5\"}"}
